  "given_answer": "\\(\\frac { 7 } { 3 }\\)",
  "answer": "\\(\\frac { 7 } { 3 }\\)",
  "given_solution": "【分析】本题考查比例的性质，利用设参法求值即可．\n【详解】解：∵\\(\\frac { x } { y }=\\frac { 3 } { 4 }\\)，\n∴设\\(x=3k，y=4k\\)，\n∴\\(\\frac { 3k+4k } { 3k }=\\frac { 7 } { 3 }\\)；\n故答案为：\\(\\frac { 7 } { 3 }\\)．",
